        ],
        "text": "According to Lawrence D. Rosenberg, petitioner argues that the State's tax exemption violates Section 111 because it discriminates based on the source of compensation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Michael R. Huston",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fef54ebfe86be0cc2207d9b6a119fb160378e0c8df1ba3bc86047e36ea3685cf",
