            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Michael R. Huston, an amicus supports the view that the exemption is facially discriminatory."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fef54ebfe86be0cc2207d9b6a119fb160378e0c8df1ba3bc86047e36ea3685cf",
