            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 31,
              "start": 31
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The State contends that the exemption is based on contribution rates or Social Security contributions, not discrimination."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fef54ebfe86be0cc2207d9b6a119fb160378e0c8df1ba3bc86047e36ea3685cf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fef54ebfe86b-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The governing statute prohibits discrimination against an officer or employee because of the source of pay or compensation."
      }
